        "slc_8cb6af010012b46b3f4a0c7bfd8da1fdc6126f9e9605585cc59a8751b13aa86b"
      ],
      "text": "Aizen is documented as a single static binary (~34 MB, ~10 ms cold start claimed) requiring no Node, Python, Docker, or cloud account, targeting Windows, Linux, and macOS."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3af7ab718bcdc97d5b61b3ee2be67fce744197e4861011292aebe22c1f89bfbf",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
