        },
        {
          "commit": "997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be",
          "git_sha": "a63ecce88778cde475c3a710cc26839c10a7141e",
          "line_end": 11,
          "line_start": 10,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "talmetis-labs/aizen",
          "url": "https://github.com/talmetis-labs/aizen/blob/997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be/README.md#L10-L11"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3c4fd0703eb2b313838826aeae9a0da5d6acdc23a4d3b0f50d818d80ffc0515e",
        "slc_68ed27e546b4503253b9b0e4f70b1b0a60a202f5be7e246099d757cc0c35b1fb"
      ],
      "text": "The agent accepts any OpenAI-style /chat/completions endpoint, including OpenAI, OpenRouter, local llama.cpp/vLLM, or an Anthropic gateway."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7bc1e401d59be4d25fc94a0d810f93d5808a5f468b6e6dcb30c793f993ad1c77",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be",
          "git_sha": "a63ecce88778cde475c3a710cc26839c10a7141e",
          "line_end": 113,
          "line_start": 108,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "talmetis-labs/aizen",
          "url": "https://github.com/talmetis-labs/aizen/blob/997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be/README.md#L108-L113"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e83a024e872206ed47554c5b28984b7426cc43a21bfaccfd2433ff2fd7903bc6"
      ],
      "text": "A 'Pantheon' of seven capability-scoped sub-agents (argus, metis, daedalus, nemesis, themis, clio, mnemosyne) is fanned out via `aizen workflow`, which synthesizes one answer."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6f5411b8c7a55f2cf10ddaf47c3f2a726f7e2e064f1c513f8c7aefbd6ddb9e6a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be",
          "git_sha": "a63ecce88778cde475c3a710cc26839c10a7141e",
          "line_end": 94,
          "line_start": 87,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "talmetis-labs/aizen",
          "url": "https://github.com/talmetis-labs/aizen/blob/997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be/README.md#L87-L94"
        },
        {
          "commit": "997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be",
          "git_sha": "5667376320aead261a4d761c7aa56abce2e6c9f9",
          "line_end": 108,
          "line_start": 101,
          "path": "docs/SANDBOX.md",
          "repository": "talmetis-labs/aizen",
          "url": "https://github.com/talmetis-labs/aizen/blob/997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be/docs/SANDBOX.md#L101-L108"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3c4fd0703eb2b313838826aeae9a0da5d6acdc23a4d3b0f50d818d80ffc0515e",
        "slc_8ae272b1eae9b7a40d004341812ae0453c8546c6f50176e495357b77f5903c02"
      ],
      "text": "The sandbox runs commands without inheriting API keys, denies network by default, and enforces filesystem policy via Landlock+seccomp on Linux and Seatbelt on macOS; Windows uses Job-Object containment and reports 'partial'."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5f074ab5b4c50963369dcd51fc8e9853f5571046eb318299442ed63cfdff038e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be",
          "git_sha": "5667376320aead261a4d761c7aa56abce2e6c9f9",
          "line_end": 90,
          "line_start": 85,
          "path": "docs/SANDBOX.md",
          "repository": "talmetis-labs/aizen",
          "url": "https://github.com/talmetis-labs/aizen/blob/997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be/docs/SANDBOX.md#L85-L90"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0a4cd5cbe3c76f9eed490fa8b1e5bbd3949a458e1ee5eff0fbd31aef5f355575"
      ],
      "text": "Sandbox modes are auto (default), strict, guarded, and off; strict refuses spawns rather than downgrading, and unattended runs fail closed unless sandbox.allow_guarded_fallback is true."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3ebecac6d2c2ef8b24fdad97feae964bc5f1f9d5f2bb8fca855285e3a2a5899f",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be",
          "git_sha": "5667376320aead261a4d761c7aa56abce2e6c9f9",
          "line_end": 46,
          "line_start": 41,
          "path": "docs/SANDBOX.md",
          "repository": "talmetis-labs/aizen",
          "url": "https://github.com/talmetis-labs/aizen/blob/997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be/docs/SANDBOX.md#L41-L46"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_66052295964d7b15257cba9b93d6d4756cdb8dc3ea092cb2184c590fdabc32d0"
      ],
      "text": "Approval (ask/smart/yolo plus a cmd_guard hard floor) is separate from the sandbox: even approved commands get no secrets, no network, and no out-of-workspace writes where kernel backends exist."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8207e6c9419d8e63eb62d7cba4b27e1c2c5bb05ab922b6e5341db7eaccd769cb",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be",
          "git_sha": "a63ecce88778cde475c3a710cc26839c10a7141e",
          "line_end": 94,
          "line_start": 87,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "talmetis-labs/aizen",
          "url": "https://github.com/talmetis-labs/aizen/blob/997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be/README.md#L87-L94"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3c4fd0703eb2b313838826aeae9a0da5d6acdc23a4d3b0f50d818d80ffc0515e"
      ],
      "text": "The agent is documented to keep an offline BM25-ranked memory that learns from reuse, plus a persona, a durable 'SOUL' identity, and skills it writes for itself after real work."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_85b8d7c10e6cdeff1f76449391c3adc777b5bb21bb6ba95008d87c03e8a9178b",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be",
          "git_sha": "5667376320aead261a4d761c7aa56abce2e6c9f9",
          "line_end": 68,
          "line_start": 55,
          "path": "docs/SANDBOX.md",
          "repository": "talmetis-labs/aizen",
          "url": "https://github.com/talmetis-labs/aizen/blob/997bdd3bbba4222a9d67322a10f026146853e7be/docs/SANDBOX.md#L55-L68"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_f55bcc0fe4452817eb80c5a6d59575316fe5fb9860fce7e6a192b049a7bd5cb1"
      ],
      "text": "The sandbox code is organized under src/sandbox with modules for policy, capabilities, a single runner that builds sandboxed commands, audit logging, and per-platform backends (guarded, linux, windows, macos)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_05385f8d7a9cc631ed358706d5d7b0605b6d4c2f235b4036d0eddbf945489337",
